  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Well that's interesting you know, because I have found Tonga on the maps. It is south east from Fiji, but not named. \n</p><p>So if it's underwater, why is it still there?\n</p><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://blog.petaflop.de/wp-content/uploads/2008/10/weltkarte-meeresspiegel-anstieg-um-100m-100-meter-metres-world-map-sea-level-rise.jpg\">http://blog.petaflop.de/wp-content/uploads/2008/10/weltkarte-meeresspiegel-anstieg-um-100m-100-meter-metres-world-map-sea-level-rise.jpg</a>\n</p><p>Some Island nations aren't even threatened. I'll be back later to finish this too.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119205651\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.003 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.003 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenaissance:pcache:idhash:1500-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261119205651 and revision id 3523. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
